  "caption": "Room only, B&B, half board, full board or all inclusive. Same hotel, very different stay.\n\nRoom only is just the bed. B&B adds breakfast. Half board adds one main meal, usually dinner. Full board covers all three meals. All inclusive adds many drinks and snacks, but what's included changes from one hotel to the next, so read the room description.\n\nSave this for your next booking.\n\n#hotelbooking #traveltips #allinclusive",
